        google: { rating: 4.6, review_count: 40, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=12053666019726624402&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Anthony Wilson', rating: 5, text: 'Great people very personable came and the owner was very knowledgeable. I think his name was Alex. Every customer I seen come in every time I go gets treated with high respect and honor. He’s an army vet so I very much appreciate him even more for that. definitely will keep on coming back to get my supply from him.', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Lenard Sallis', rating: 5, text: 'DNA Dispensary is hands down one of the best spots around! Deedra and Alex have created a welcoming, knowledgeable environment where you never feel rushed or judged. They take the time to help you find exactly what you’re looking for, whether you’re new or experienced. Great products, great people, and great vibes every time. LOVE this place, I absolutely recommend them!', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Jessica and Larissa at Going Green', rating: 5, text: 'We had a really great time working with them. Everything went smoothly and their team was flexible and easy to coordinate with, which made things pretty stress-free for us. We appreciated how collaborative and easygoing they were, and we’d definitely be happy to work together again.', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'lisa nicole', rating: 5, text: 'I’m from out of state, and I’m a medical patient back where I live. I decided to come here due to the experience of the history of it. I met the owner and he was so kind and welcoming.  He helped me pick out great pre rolls, and we discussed cannabis specifics etc. the hospitality was great :) I’ll definitely come back when I’m in town.', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'cleopatra jonesing', rating: 5, text: 'as someone who regularly visits dispos in portland, nyc, and the twin cities, i had a great experience at dna. alex helped me and was super professional, kind, and attentive. they have disposable and threaded vapes which is rare for the area. i definitely recommend dna!', time: '8 months ago'}] }
