        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/396/065/avatar/1781220179-screenshot_2026-06-11_at_4-21-40___pm.png",
        google: { rating: 4.9, review_count: 540, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=17656767879368606479&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'MNlakeland', rating: 5, text: 'Nice crew works here. Casey is his name and always provides good guidance.  You wait in lobby and go in and shop personally, lobby is comfy. Line is quick and arrested development is usually on TV. Thats a comic genius show, soo...they have good taste in comedy. And product what can I say...all good 👍', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Cindy Christians', rating: 5, text: 'I was customer 126 for their grand opening on 03/21/2026 in Maple Grove - the first recreational dispensary in my city!!  I found the experience to be very relaxed and organized. Their waiting room felt like a movie theater.  Once my number was called, I went into the back secure show floor and was met by a friendly salesperson.  I was most interested in finding their specialty products (ice cream', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Nick G', rating: 5, text: 'Im a fan! Interesting way of managing foot traffic for a weed shop, but the guy behind the counter was very personable and friendly. Really wish them well, I think I got a pretty good deal today considering MN prices and taxes. They are a bit tucked away on the side of the building, but it seems like its getting popular! Good product spread - just the stuff I like.', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Evan Garber', rating: 5, text: 'FULLMELT FACTORY is hands down the best dispensary in the Minneapolis/St. Paul area. The environment is super chill and the staff is extremely knowledgeable and personable. They have the best products and service! If you haven\'t been yet, go today! I promise you that you won\'t regret it, in fact you will wish you could personally thank me for leading you to the ONLY PLACE TO BE= FULLMELT FACTORY', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Brandon K', rating: 5, text: 'I stopped last night because I was in the mood for a preroll after work.  The bud tenders were knowledgeable about the products and they were really friendly also.  I found my new favorite MN dispensary.   I highly recommend giving Full Melt a visit', time: '5 months ago'}] }
