        google: { rating: 4.2, review_count: 54, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=17364636064590845062&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Coree', rating: 5, text: 'Decided to check this store out instead of driving an hour to my regular shop and I’m pleasantly surprised! The only brand I’ve had so far was their Campfire Cannabis, tried two different strains and both were equally as great. Looked good, smelled good, and tasted good. Staff has also been super helpful every time Ive been there. Would recommend.  Hopefully you guys will sell carts and disposable', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Alexander the Great', rating: 5, text: 'Stopped into the Dundas location and had a great experience. The staff was friendly, knowledgeable, and made the whole process easy and comfortable. They have a solid selection, fair prices, and a welcoming atmosphere. It’s clear they care about their customers and take pride in what they do. Definitely worth checking out if you’re in the area.', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Marcel Hofker', rating: 5, text: 'I love this spot! The staff is friendly and knowledgeable. I love the fact they have legal cannabis, its early on so I expect their to be prices the same as everyone else\'s till there\'s an abundance of cannabis. Abbey is a treat too, getting to see her there regularly is great.', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Alicia Gonzales', rating: 2, text: 'Very little selection and OVER PRICED! The employees were friendly that’s why I gave a two star. This company should definitely go back to the drawing board and figure out a plan because what’s implemented right now is not it!', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'DJ Lee', rating: 4, text: 'There were 6 strands of hair attached to 4 nugs of tropicana cherry I ground up. For a $55 4g, not sure how happy I am about that. However the atmosphere is nice, and the budtender was kind. Also there’s only one flavor/type of edibles.', time: '3 months ago'}] }
