        review_count: 62,
        verified: false,
        features: ["Large menu", "Curbside pickup", "Online ordering"],
        gradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #92400e, #d97706)',
        initial: 'LS',
        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/406/707/avatar/1779404029-7775e79d-a626-4d93-a775-cd2fb52954ee.PNG",
        google: { rating: 4.1, review_count: 62, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=4807855919563758862&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Jennifer Bakken', rating: 5, text: 'For a small and new business they offered a good variety, and were well prepared for questions with well thought out answers.  The business is in a clean and safe area, and the business is owned by women who are delightful.  As someone who suffers from chronic pain, I refuse to be sucked into treatment via opioids, cannabis is a much safer and not addictive alternative!  I’ll be back!', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Hannah Valerius', rating: 5, text: 'Very clean, adorable decor, nice and knowledgeable staff, stuff has to go through testing so it takes longer but it’s still great flower!', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'John', rating: 5, text: 'Very Nice, Clean place with lots to choose from.. What I initially went in for, apparently isn’t even legal yet in MN 🤷‍♂️, but what she had in store was more than enough to keep me in supply, and on my way.  Very friendly, knowledgeable, and even gave me some free samples on my way out the door…a little bit of old fashioned, person to person, we appreciate your business, customer service was a ni', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'N L', rating: 1, text: 'Straight up scammed, AVOID! Walked in looking for an 8th, was directed to a recommended strain, price wasn\'t bad, felt good about everything except that I had to use their in store ATM because they don\'t accept cards.  Get home, check it out, CDB hemp flower..... I\'m not picky on THC percentage, but damn, if I walk into a dispensary, I do want THC not CBD, as anyone would.  Clearly they know they\'', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'Alix M', rating: 1, text: 'I walked in and asked if they carried THC products. She said yes, but little did I know everything was Delta 9 and hemp-derived. I spent $74 on stuff that I don\'t consider authentic. I feel like I was lied to, not a great business model. I definitely won\'t be going back, especially since they don\'t have a return policy.', time: '10 months ago'}] }
