        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/400/574/avatar/1776729651-wildflower-logos_avatar-northeast.jpg",
        google: { rating: 4.7, review_count: 114, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=11438091904175603222&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Breanna Barr', rating: 5, text: 'The staff is so friendly and helpful! They were able to answer my questions confidently and help me make my choices. And the space is warm and inviting! Will definitely be coming back soon!', time: '10 months ago'}, {author: 'Erin Kaine', rating: 5, text: 'Woop woop! We love a dispensary in the city with a parking lot &&&&& finally has flower for sale 💚🌱🙌🏼  Updates: love the Grapes N Cream! Great gassy hybrid that burns super clean. That’s what we like to see 👏🏼👏🏼', time: '10 months ago'}, {author: 'Qianna Stibbins', rating: 5, text: 'Grace and Brittany are AMAZING!! Everyone here is so kind and knowledgeable about their products, I love coming in here! 10/10 would recommend stopping by!', time: 'a week ago'}, {author: 'lekaloo', rating: 5, text: 'Any review mentioning rude staff or bizarre interactions strikes me as projecting or hypercritical. Like these people could walk into a yoga studio and declare one of the plants as distracting or intrusive. Problems can be found anywhere you look long enough to make one (or if there’s bias- can’t help but wonder if some of these folks expect femme presenting people to bend over backwards and coddl', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Margaux Pierra', rating: 4, text: 'The place is stunning and the budtenders are lovely, the gummy selection is nice and they have good bud + vapes I will be coming back for those! … the pre rolls are kind of a rip off though for $22.75 after tax & card fees for an unsealed joint (a lot of loose bud in the cone) that was really badly rolled :( had to re roll at home', time: '4 months ago'}] }
