        initial: 'LC',
        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/403/049/avatar/1775614838-mpls-wm-logo.png",
        google: { rating: 4.5, review_count: 110, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=2549655575304561888&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Emily Swanson', rating: 5, text: 'Great selection. I liked the physical menu I could hold. Queen was so helpful. She helped my friend and I that had totally different questions. She was awesome! Cool location too. Art quality glass shop next door. We’ll be back.', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Derek Perez', rating: 2, text: 'Definitely, not the best dispensary in Minnesota. They mislabeled the menu saying that the lit og was 27% percent. I took a look at my bag when I got on the car.It says 24.3%. I went back to see if I can return it since I didn\'t even open the bag yet. They just said since I left the building, I can\'t exchange it or return it. Even though the product was mislabeled Funny thing is, they didn\'t even ', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'dalton jahnke', rating: 5, text: 'Stopped by Legacy Cannabis in Minneapolis and had a great experience. The staff was super friendly and actually took the time to answer questions and make solid recommendations without rushing anything. You can tell they really know their products.  The shop itself has a clean, welcoming vibe and feels more like a local spot than a big corporate dispensary. Everything was organized, easy to browse', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: '254Shad', rating: 1, text: 'So legacy just opened up recently in uptown, like a lot of you I was excited about trying it. I’ve went it and spent a lot of money on overpriced products, regardless I’m here to support the business. I’ve told my friends about it and people that I know just word of mouth. I started liking the Lite Og Indica strain , only one I like there. After the 2 time of grabbing it I started weighing it and ', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'Eric S Hungerford', rating: 5, text: 'Since the first day I was in town, these guys have been solid and consistent.  The staff is super helpful and friendly, and the strains I\'ve tried are pretty dang great. The gummies are also beyond delicious.  The glass shop is phenomenal, with all kinds of fun stuff from a whole lot of artists from pretty much everywhere.  And, to top it off, you can learn to blow glass and rent space to do it.  ', time: '6 months ago'}] }
