        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/static/placeholders/weedmaps-logo.jpg",
        google: { rating: 4.6, review_count: 2134, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=10091604970785504202&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'James Doyle', rating: 5, text: '10/5 stars ALWAYS. Coming into a place like this, with staff members who can anticipate your needs with very little prior knowledge of your tastes/preferences is a GODSEND! Shout out to Tara for always making us feel at home and taken care of!', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Megan Grill', rating: 1, text: 'I called today with a few questions about the leaf marijauna because it seems more cost effective but I don’t know a lot about it. I also had questions about payment knowing it needs to be debit but whether or not they or their ATM take Apple Pay bc I left my card at home in my other purse. I started out asking about the pay which was maybe the first problem. The gal on the phone was very impatien', time: 'a week ago'}, {author: 'Jo Anna Thomas', rating: 5, text: 'Great.. Use kiosks stand in line get order move along .. Great speedy service nice place you can get your medicine there along with, shirts, hats, bowls, papers etc .. Nice and calm must have ID.... amazing flower....', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Megan VanDiver', rating: 5, text: '6/5 stars for Noah. ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐  Noah made the whole experience easy and enjoyable. He anticipated the debit card reader prompts before I could even look confused, which saved me from my usual “wait, am I tapping, inserting, or sacrificing a goat to the machine?” moment.  He was friendly, knowledgeable, and genuinely made me smile. Also, credit where credit is due: the man has legitimately cool hair. S', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'JX', rating: 5, text: 'Excellent service at this location. Never wait more than a few minutes for order pickup. Look for deals on both the medical and recreational sides to score best product prices. Some products are not licensed for medical, however are licensed for recreational. Same products, just how it\'s licensed to sell.', time: 'a month ago'}] }
