        google: { rating: 4.5, review_count: 83, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=16134270424750811827&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Lacey Lindholm', rating: 5, text: 'This is the best dispensary in Minnesota. Not only are the employees and products great, but the store owner is incredibly loyal to all of their customers. I recently bought a product and realized there was a quantity issue; I reached out to the store and they were so incredibly nice and understanding about the situation. I just got off of the phone with the owner and he was extremely apologetic a', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'COVID-Shark', rating: 5, text: 'When I walked in I was taken back my the small welcoming area. Then you go back to see what they have to offer and it’s a nice setup. There are two hidden gems here. The people and their flower selection. Unbound is the best flower in MN (my opinion of course). They are always nice buds. They are always fluffy yet dense. The humidity is right on point for what I would expect from a premium flower.', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'William Powell', rating: 2, text: 'Been here a few times, staff is super friendly, quality of product is good. However I decided to weigh the product out of a brand new 4g bag to see if it\'s right and it weighed 3.85. With how expensive it is, the weight should be right...... confirmed my scales accuracy with calibrated weights', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Dave Raymond', rating: 5, text: 'Quality team, quality products. I met Keith, Tony, Brian, Mona, + one additional talented individual. Knowledge and attention to detail is excellent.  Price, well a little higher than expected, but there is nothing like operating profit to smooth out the inevitable bumps a small business encounters.', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'Jennifer Powers', rating: 4, text: 'This was my first visit to a higher place and for the most part it was a good experience, it’s a nice set up and everyone was nice and helpful. I really liked the pre-rolls that I purchased.  Now that that’s said it was the exit that was a doozy, I didn’t notice whether there was a Sign warning about the step out the exit, when I stepped out the exit It was farther down than I was expecting and I ', time: '2 months ago'}] }
