        initial: 'SW',
        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/386/834/avatar/1776992111-400x400.png",
        google: { rating: 4.9, review_count: 552, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=5889851026020320896&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Andrew Kappel', rating: 5, text: 'Was greeted by Kari at check-in with a genuine, warm welcome—great energy from the moment I walked in.  Once I hit the sales floor, Peter took over and was super easy to talk to. He walked me through the Rewards sign-up process and made the entire experience feel effortless.  I also noticed Chadwick, the manager on duty, actively working the sales floor and supporting his team. As a retail leader,', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Samuel Bolton', rating: 4, text: 'Send us coupons. ❤️ Wonderful store and excellent people.', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'sara abella', rating: 5, text: 'Very welcoming team! I was greeted by Ezra, and additionally informed about everything and anything by Eli and Peter. I will definitely be back soon!', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Max Hollenback', rating: 1, text: 'False advertising and poor accessibility! I looked online at Sweetleaves for post‑surgery pain relief for my broken leg. Their website advertised 84% THC for Durban Poison and Pineapple Express carts. I couldn\'t order online, so I ordered over the phone. When I went, the store has steps and no ramp, making it very difficult to access with a scooter. My mistake? When I went into the store, they sai', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Delany Breitbach', rating: 5, text: 'Always a trusted place for shopping for cannabis products. The staff are super friendly and knowledgeable, and the store is always super clean, beautifully organized with products displayed, and had a lovely, inviting atmosphere. Some items are a little pricey, but you know it’s great product (what’s in it, where it came from) and you’re supporting a local business :-) Thanks y’all, you rock!!', time: '2 months ago'}] }
