        initial: 'GG',
        img: null,
        google: { rating: 4.4, review_count: 457, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=16575895052456821740&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Kris Hippe', rating: 5, text: 'Since I became a medical patient years ago, this place has always been my go to the staff is always amazing welcoming and warming and professional and the product is absolutely top-notch. I would never go anywhere else. I love you guys. Keep up the great work.!! And bonus if Prince is there the little dog he’s so cute!!', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Waddles', rating: 5, text: 'I’ve tried RISE twice now for adult use and both times were very disappointing, the flower was extremely dry with low potency. Tried Green Goods for the first time yesterday and was impressed by the improvement in product. Nice buds with a fantastic high. I ordered ahead online and didn’t have to wait long for pick up. The employee helping us out was very friendly. Will definitely be back!', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'JJ ODonnell', rating: 5, text: 'I had ordered my medicine before the store opened.  I went into the store as normal.  There were only 2 people working in the store one was at the door and the other was at the counter.  There was a guy in there who began getting upset because of a 5 minute wait time.  The staff were professional and kept their cool.  As the man was threatening to leave if he didn\'t get his stuff soon.  Staff just', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Emma Sattler', rating: 5, text: 'Welcoming, mellow, professional, knowledgable staff. You select your product in the store via one of their several available ipads, then they gather your selected items from the back and ready for checkout in less than 5 mins.  I appreciate the buying experience with use of iPad, because it allows you to browse available items and take your time / ask questions if needed, rather than feeling rushe', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'kendra yates', rating: 5, text: 'Way better than rise! A lot more happy, picking up is always quick there’s never a wait. The quality and deals are amazing compared to rise. Love coming here for adult use', time: '2 months ago'}] }
