        google: { rating: 4.6, review_count: 51, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=243640797286413634&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'NicolE', rating: 5, text: 'Friend referred me to check this place out, stopped in this weekend. This place is recently new and has so much potential. Met the owners who are very nice, drinks were delicious! Prices aren’t super cheap, but you’re not very over priced for what you get. Mary Jane champagne was my favorite. They have endless opportunities with this place! Only downfall is location isn’t the best; but I will be b', time: '3 years ago'}, {author: 'MN Weed Events', rating: 5, text: 'Visited this place for Stoner Bingo and was very impressed with the social atmosphere. This is a great place to bring your friends to enjoy board games, Walking Dead arcade game, table tennis, chess/checkers, and Super Nintendo games.  They service THC drinks; no food was listed on the menu, but I believe they sell gummies and other treats. There is free parking at the back of the building.  Just ', time: '2 years ago'}, {author: 'Jeremy Davis', rating: 5, text: 'The space was perfect for our event - a sweet 16 party.  So much to do, and the staff and ownership were extremely accommodating.  We have nothing but positive things to say about the service and the space.  Audio was great.   Karaoke was perfect.  Such a cool place.  And again, the staff were amazing. Would definitely recommend this spot and hope to be back soon. We appreciate everything!', time: 'a year ago'}, {author: 'Gary Carver', rating: 5, text: 'It’s a cute little place! The staff are friendly and the product is a fun novelty that enhances the soda shop experience. Fun way to hang with friends to kick off a night out. Highly recommend!', time: '3 years ago'}, {author: 'Joseph Meyer', rating: 5, text: 'This place was amazing! It\'s everything that has been missing for so long. It feels like a bar except not one drop of alcohol is present. Drinks were amazing all night, nothing like drinking smoothies and feeling good. Not having a hangover the next day and the chill vibe is the best thing ever. Definitely worth your time to stop and check things out, I am sure you\'ll find something that interests', time: '2 years ago'}] }
