        google: { rating: 4.8, review_count: 129, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=3226216604501574224&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'fre3radical', rating: 5, text: 'I liked these guys. Pretty tasty flower, the smell is great. Great shop with great deals! Nice accessories! Best since Cass Lake! Down to the ocean I go. Thanks again!', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'candie Godwin', rating: 5, text: 'This is the place to go to. The knowledge Justin and Kirk have is very helpful. The prices are beyond reasonable.  Give this place your business. JUST GOT HOME AND LIT MY BLUNT THIS IS GOOOOD SHIT! YOU HAVE MY BUSINESS FOR LIFE! Special thanks to Kirk I asked for a sativa and a bed time indica. Totally nailed the sativa!', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Travis Truman', rating: 5, text: 'Great quality in Dakota County. Has selection of pieces. Kirk and Justin doing fantastic.', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Ambria Allison', rating: 5, text: 'Justin has promoted this place so well that I don’t even smoke weed but I like to go in and buy some goodies as gifts for my friends who do partake! I won’t go unless I know he’s working for his next awesome recommendation that’s for sure.', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Sammie H', rating: 5, text: 'Highly recommend this spot! The vibe is incredibly relaxed and welcoming. Shoutout to Justin for making the experience seamless—he answered my questions, was very friendly and I didn’t feel pressured. I\'ll definitely be back!', time: '3 months ago'}] }
